{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_01",
      "hash": "57c1120001ae0af3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You look like someone who wants to try your\\nown strength!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_02",
      "hash": "57c1130001ae0ca6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do you want to have a Pokémon battle with me,\\na Coach Trainer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub074_select_01",
      "hash": "013750f68b0487bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Battle"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub074_select_02",
      "hash": "013751f68b04896e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Not now"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_03",
      "hash": "57c1140001ae0e59",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub074_system_01",
      "hash": "2b3d4cd5a8dc3f60",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_04",
      "hash": "57c1150001ae100c",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OK! Here I come!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_05",
      "hash": "57c1160001ae11bf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You won’t battle?\\nOK, maybe next time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_06",
      "hash": "57c1170001ae1372",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You defeated a Coach Trainer, just like that!\\nIn honor of your strength, I have a gift for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_07",
      "hash": "57c1180001ae1525",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Revives will heal a Pokémon that’s been\\nknocked out—something that a Potion can’t do!\\c\\nBe sure to use them wisely!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_01",
      "hash": "2d431a0b4b16c83c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hello there! I’m a Coach Trainer, at your service!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_02",
      "hash": "2d431d0b4b16cd55",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do you want to train a bit before taking on\\nMt. Moon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_03",
      "hash": "2d431c0b4b16cba2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_04",
      "hash": "2d43170b4b16c323",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Are you ready?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_05",
      "hash": "2d43160b4b16c170",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I guess you didn’t need to battle.\\nOK. Next time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_06",
      "hash": "2d43190b4b16c689",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "That was a great battle!\\nTake this, as thanks."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_02_07",
      "hash": "2d43180b4b16c4d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM57 is for the move Pay Day.\\c\\nIt’s a move that’ll scatter money around that\\nyou can pick up later for a little extra\\r\\npocket money!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_01",
      "hash": "5afd2611adf275d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "This area is popular for dates.\\c\\nI’m a proudly independent Coach Trainer\\nat a date spot!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_02",
      "hash": "5afd2311adf270b8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’ll let you know, I’m pretty strong.\\nWant me to battle you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_03",
      "hash": "5afd2411adf2726b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_04",
      "hash": "5afd2911adf27aea",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’ll give you a real workout!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_05",
      "hash": "5afd2a11adf27c9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Let me know if you change your mind."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_06",
      "hash": "5afd2711adf27784",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Whew, I haven’t had fun like that in a long time!\\nHere, take this!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_03_07",
      "hash": "5afd2811adf27937",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM15 is for Seismic Toss.\\c\\nIt deals damage equal to the level of the\\nPokémon that uses the move."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_01",
      "hash": "a5a55dd9f6d0fec2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Don’t you like Route 11? The double ones in its\\nname are so cool!\\c\\nAnd guess what!\\nI’m the Coach Trainer on Route “Double One”!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_02",
      "hash": "a5a55cd9f6d0fd0f",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I am a Coach Trainer!\\nThink you can take me on?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_03",
      "hash": "a5a55bd9f6d0fb5c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 26]"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_04",
      "hash": "a5a55ad9f6d0f9a9",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I won’t hold back!\\nYaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_05",
      "hash": "a5a559d9f6d0f7f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You won’t battle?\\nOK. Next time."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_06",
      "hash": "a5a558d9f6d0f643",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’re strong!\\nYou’ve got me in a good mood, so take these."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_04_07",
      "hash": "a5a557d9f6d0f490",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "If you use [VAR INDEF_ART(0002)][VAR POKNAME(0002)] Candy,\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)] will get much stronger.\\c\\nIf you want to get Candy for a specific Pokémon,\\ntry catching that species over and over or send\\r\\nthem to the professor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_01",
      "hash": "fd5129e1934f8537",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The Rock Tunnel is a tough place.\\nWhy don’t you train here before you go?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_02",
      "hash": "fd512ae1934f86ea",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’ll train you every step of the way, if you want."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_03",
      "hash": "fd512be1934f889d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 33]"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_04",
      "hash": "fd5124e1934f7cb8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OK, kiddo!\\nI’ll give you a workout!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_05",
      "hash": "fd5125e1934f7e6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Too bad!\\nI’ll be waiting for you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_06",
      "hash": "fd5126e1934f801e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Turns out, you taught me a thing or two!\\nHere, take this. For the lesson."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_05_07",
      "hash": "fd5127e1934f81d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM13 can teach your Pokémon Brick Break.\\c\\nThis move can break through an opponent’s\\nLight Screen or Reflect."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_01",
      "hash": "295811e7f4b96120",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I w-w-want to get to the bottom of this...\\c\\nHow did a c-c-coward like me end up in charge\\nof the Pokémon Tower...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_02",
      "hash": "295814e7f4b96639",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh, a b-b-battle? Well, I’m kinda strong..."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_03",
      "hash": "295813e7f4b96486",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 40]"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_04",
      "hash": "295816e7f4b9699f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Here g-g-goes nothing!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_05",
      "hash": "295815e7f4b967ec",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Are you quitting...?\\nAre you l-l-leaving...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_06",
      "hash": "295818e7f4b96d05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "That battle took my mind off things a little bit.\\nHere, I found these lying around."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_06_07",
      "hash": "295817e7f4b96b52",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The Candies that make Pokémon stronger...\\c\\nI have a bunch, too! I keep them safe in my\\nCandy Jar..."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_01",
      "hash": "d40e5df203c5a895",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "A small path between towns...\\nTee-hee. Route 7 is nice, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_02",
      "hash": "d40e5af203c5a37c",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OK.\\nAre you ready?"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_03",
      "hash": "d40e5bf203c5a52f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 47]"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_04",
      "hash": "d40e58f203c5a016",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now let’s play...an ensemble\\ncalled a battle!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_05",
      "hash": "d40e59f203c5a1c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Tee-hee. I get it.\\nNow is not the time."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_06",
      "hash": "d40e56f203c59cb0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Thank you for the best battle.\\nHere, take a token of my gratitude."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_07_07",
      "hash": "d40e57f203c59e63",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM12 has the move Facade.\\c\\nIt’s a spunky move that deals double damage\\nif the Pokémon using it has a status condition."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_01",
      "hash": "8c35963b66cf54f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey! I’m a Coach Trainer!\\nI’m on loan to the Fighting Dojo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_02",
      "hash": "8c35953b66cf5343",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m a pretty strong Trainer!\\nWant to have a battle?"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_03",
      "hash": "8c35943b66cf5190",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 54]"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_04",
      "hash": "8c359b3b66cf5d75",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Let’s have a serious battle!\\nHiyah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_05",
      "hash": "8c359a3b66cf5bc2",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Acknowledging the difference in power is\\nalso a strength!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_06",
      "hash": "8c35993b66cf5a0f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "That was a great match!\\nI want you to have this!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_08_07",
      "hash": "8c35983b66cf585c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM23 contains Thunder Punch!\\c\\nSmash your opponents with a fist wreathed\\nin electricity!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_01",
      "hash": "37586245763794cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Training on a romantic bridge, where you can\\nsmell the sea breeze, doubles the effects of\\r\\nthe training."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_02",
      "hash": "375863457637967e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Let’s do some coaching!\\nAre you ready?"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_03",
      "hash": "3758644576379831",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 61]"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_04",
      "hash": "37586545763799e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Let a Pokémon battle begin, yo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_05",
      "hash": "3758664576379b97",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Not interested?\\nOh, what a shame..."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_06",
      "hash": "3758674576379d4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Such a romantic battle!\\n...Here, a token of my gratitude."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_09_07",
      "hash": "3758684576379efd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM59 holds the move Dream Eater.\\c\\nIt only works on Pokémon that are asleep, but...\\nI assure you, its effect is devastating."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_01",
      "hash": "709c062d51436e41",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pokémon Road is soothing, isn’t it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_02",
      "hash": "709c032d51436928",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...Huh?\\nOh, sorry. I spaced out.\\c\\nI’m a Coach Trainer. Did you want to have\\na battle?"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_03",
      "hash": "709c042d51436adb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 68]"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_04",
      "hash": "709c092d5143735a",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OK! I’m ready."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_05",
      "hash": "709c0a2d5143750d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You won’t battle...\\nThat’s OK. Take it easy."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_06",
      "hash": "709c072d51436ff4",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It was fun.\\nI think you’ll be able to put this to good use."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_10_07",
      "hash": "709c082d514371a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM58 is for Drill Run.\\c\\nIt’s this drilly move that has a higher chance\\nof scoring a critical hit."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_01",
      "hash": "6ef3ba2829d8ffec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The Trainers around here are all very strong!\\c\\nThat’s right.\\nI’ve trained every single one of them."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_02",
      "hash": "6ef3bd2829d90505",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I assume you want to get strong.\\nShall I be your battle opponent?"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_03",
      "hash": "6ef3bc2829d90352",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 75]"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_04",
      "hash": "6ef3b72829d8fad3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Here I come!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_05",
      "hash": "6ef3b62829d8f920",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I see... That’s too bad."
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_06",
      "hash": "6ef3b92829d8fe39",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I see the flame of potential in you!\\nLet me give you a TM worthy of your skill."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_11_07",
      "hash": "6ef3b82829d8fc86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You can use TM31 to teach your Pokémon the\\nmove Fire Punch.\\c\\nIt can even give an opponent a burn if\\nyou’re lucky!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_01",
      "hash": "9971b21ce07042a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey, you!\\nAre you going to Cinnabar Island, by\\r\\nany chance?"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_02",
      "hash": "9971b31ce0704456",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m bored.\\nIs it OK if I coach you a bit?"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_03",
      "hash": "9971b41ce0704609",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 82]"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_04",
      "hash": "9971b51ce07047bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "My Pokémon will be super serious!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_05",
      "hash": "9971b61ce070496f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Seriously?\\nMy sorrow is deep..."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_06",
      "hash": "9971b71ce0704b22",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’re pretty good!\\nI’m gonna give you a little present!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_12_07",
      "hash": "9971b81ce0704cd5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM35 has that move Ice Punch!\\c\\nIt’s, like, super effective against Dragon-type\\nand Grass-type Pokémon."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_01",
      "hash": "6c24c6167df19d4e",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Are you surprised to find a Coach Trainer at\\na place like this?\\c\\nBut what is more surprising is that I come here\\nevery single day..."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_02",
      "hash": "6c24c5167df19b9b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There is nothing else to do but battle here.\\nDo you want to battle?"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_03",
      "hash": "6c24c4167df199e8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 89]"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_04",
      "hash": "6c24cb167df1a5cd",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Of course you’ll battle me.\\nOK! Here I come."
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_05",
      "hash": "6c24ca167df1a41a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What’s the point of me being here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_06",
      "hash": "6c24c9167df1a267",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well, you came all the way here...\\nLet me give you something really special."
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_13_07",
      "hash": "6c24c8167df1a0b4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Don’t you feel happy when you have a whole\\nbunch of different Candies in your Candy Jar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_01",
      "hash": "15befe0ee287e045",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The abandoned Power Plant is the second least\\ndesired place for Coach Trainers to be\\r\\nassigned to."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_02",
      "hash": "15befb0ee287db2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "No matter where I am, I’m gonna do my job!"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_03",
      "hash": "15befc0ee287dcdf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 96]"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_04",
      "hash": "15bef90ee287d7c6",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I love my job!\\nHere I come!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_05",
      "hash": "15befa0ee287d979",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh?\\nYou need time to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_06",
      "hash": "15bef70ee287d460",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "If I did a great job for you, I’m more than happy.\\nHere’s a little something extra, too."
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_14_07",
      "hash": "15bef80ee287d613",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’ve got to admit, Rare Candies really get\\nthe job done!"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_01",
      "hash": "40a9f203997bee10",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh dear. I thought you were a Burglar, but\\nyou’re a kid Trainer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_02",
      "hash": "40a9f503997bf329",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well? Do you want to have some fun with\\na Coach Trainer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_03",
      "hash": "40a9f403997bf176",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 103]"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_04",
      "hash": "40a9f703997bf68f",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OK. Let’s have a Pokémon battle!"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_05",
      "hash": "40a9f603997bf4dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Not interested?"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_06",
      "hash": "40a9f903997bf9f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Battling with you is so much fun!\\nHere’s a present, just for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_15_07",
      "hash": "40a9f803997bf842",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM22 contains the move Rock Slide!\\c\\nIt’s really impressive, you know? It’s such a\\ndownpour of rocks!\\c\\nIf you’re in a Double Battle, you can hit two\\nopponents at once!"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_01",
      "hash": "3d4ec9fe70a02867",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I seek a battle..."
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_02",
      "hash": "3d4ecafe70a02a1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You...\\nDo you seek a battle?"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_03",
      "hash": "3d4ecbfe70a02bcd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 110]"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_04",
      "hash": "3d4ec4fe70a01fe8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "En garde!"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_05",
      "hash": "3d4ec5fe70a0219b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_06",
      "hash": "3d4ec6fe70a0234e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "That was delightful.\\nAllow me to demonstrate my thanks."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_16_07",
      "hash": "3d4ec7fe70a02501",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I would relish a rematch, should we have\\nthe opportunity."
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_01",
      "hash": "68393df327935cb2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Wow! Your Pokémon [VAR ITEMPLUR1(00FD,0302)]isare so cute!"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_02",
      "hash": "68393cf327935aff",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m a Coach Trainer!\\nCome on, battle me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_03",
      "hash": "68393bf32793594c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 117]"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_04",
      "hash": "68393af327935799",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m super excited!\\nIt’ll be a spectacle!"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_05",
      "hash": "683939f3279355e6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What? That’s too bad.\\c\\nLet’s do it next time.\\nPromise me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_06",
      "hash": "683938f327935433",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Ahaha! That was fun!\\nHere, this’ll come in handy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_17_07",
      "hash": "683937f327935280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "TM39 can be used to teach your Pokémon\\nthe move Outrage.\\c\\nYou know what they say about cheerful folks like\\nme—you don’t want to get us angry!"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_01",
      "hash": "fb08b67051709a59",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey, Champion!\\c\\nYou’re allowed to enter this cave!\\nFrom now on, I’ll face you as a Coach Trainer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_02",
      "hash": "fb08b37051709540",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Are you ready?\\nThen let’s battle!"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_03",
      "hash": "fb08b470517096f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 124]"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_04",
      "hash": "fb08b97051709f72",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Are you ready, Champion?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_05",
      "hash": "fb08ba705170a125",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "If you change your mind, battle me."
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_06",
      "hash": "fb08b77051709c0c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What a great battle!\\nThat’s what I expected from a Champion!\\c\\nI didn’t stand a chance...\\nPlease, accept this from me."
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_18_07",
      "hash": "fb08b87051709dbf",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I hear the Pokémon in the Cerulean Cave are\\nterrifyingly strong...\\c\\nOf course, I’m just a guard, so I don’t know\\nfor sure."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_01",
      "hash": "cf6eca69f0638984",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m Morimoto.\\c\\nI’m helping out the Coach Trainers.\\nI’ve got my own reasons."
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_02",
      "hash": "cf6ecd69f0638e9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do you really want to battle me, the strongest\\nCoach Trainer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_03",
      "hash": "cf6ecc69f0638cea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 131]"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_04",
      "hash": "cf6ec769f063846b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Here I go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_05",
      "hash": "cf6ec669f06382b8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I see. OK, next time."
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_06",
      "hash": "cf6ec969f06387d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You’re strong.\\nI’ll give you this."
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_19_07",
      "hash": "cf6ec869f063861e",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I hope you catch a bunch of Pokémon and\\nlove each and every one of them!"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_08",
      "hash": "57c1190001ae16d8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh, you’re a new Trainer."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_09",
      "hash": "57c11a0001ae188b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m a Coach Trainer.\\c\\nCoach Trainers are the ones who stand in\\nvarious places to train Trainers. I’m one of them."
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_09not",
      "hash": "ea06bd27e78a6c2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 138]"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "id": "msg_sub074_system_02",
      "hash": "2b3d4fd5a8dc4479",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 139]"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_10",
      "hash": "57c4970001b122c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "We Coach Trainers are strong, if I do say\\nso myself!"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "id": "msg_sub074_coach_01_11",
      "hash": "57c4960001b12116",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "If you want to try out your strength,\\nyou should definitely battle us."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "id": "msg_sub074_shop_01",
      "hash": "7af1cbb7bd0ad8bf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 142]"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "id": "msg_sub074_shop_system_01",
      "hash": "91c01030e481a3b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 143]"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "id": "msg_sub074_shop_02",
      "hash": "7af1ccb7bd0ada72",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 144]"
    }
  ],
